  "name": "Bio-Plasma Breath",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/fire/breath-acid-fire-cone-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with an exhalation of thermal plasma:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Shape: Choose a 15-foot Cone or a 30-foot Line that is 5 feet wide.</li>\n  <li>Damage: Each creature in the area must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC = 8 + your Constitution modifier + your Proficiency Bonus). A creature takes 1d10 Fire or Cold damage (chosen when you select your lineage) on a failed save, or half as much on a successful one.</li>\n  <li>Scaling: The damage increases to 2d10 at 5th level, 3d10 at 11th level, and 4d10 at 17th level.</li>\n  <li>Uses: You can use this breath weapon a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or Long Rest.</li>\n</ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
